    producer negotiates importable memory before the stream starts.
  * Offer the qualified input domain in unfiltered reverse caps answers.
  * Render the explicit SDR destination from a sampleable PQ intermediate.
  * Do not renegotiate inside a flush while a newer revision awaits the
    stream's own restart.

